Need More Tokens
Copyright (c) 2026 Andrew Lee

Need More Tokens reads provider usage directly from each provider's own systems
(Anthropic, OpenAI, Google) using native HTTPS clients. It does not depend on or
invoke any external command-line tool. All data is read locally and is never
transmitted anywhere.

The widget snapshot / App Group sharing architecture in this project was
originally informed by the design of CodexBar by Peter Steinberger
(https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar, MIT) and re-implemented independently
here. No CodexBar source code is included or linked.
